    + '<div class="noprint" style="text-align:right"><button onclick="window.print()" style="padding:8px 16px;cursor:pointer">Imprimer / PDF</button></div>'
    + '<div class="ai-mark"><span class="ai-badge">AI GENERATED</span> Document g\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9 par un syst\u00e8me d\u2019intelligence artificielle (IA Act, art. 50).</div><h1>Rapport IA Act annuel personnalis\u00e9</h1>'
    + '<div class="meta">\u00c9dit\u00e9 le '+today+' \u2014 CONSEILPREV / Sentinel</div>'
